&HEAD CHID='arad_ritual60_low', TITLE='Arad shrine Str. X - 60 min ritual, 20 g cannabis per 10 min, 5 cm altar mesh, LOW: hall 2.4 m, cella niche 1.8 m, door 2.2 m' /

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Enhanced run (follows the 4-scenario sensitivity study):
   * cannabis 2 g/min (20 g per 10 min, 120 g over the hour), 5% THC, 50% released
     -> THC 50 mg/min.  Frankincense unchanged (0.5 g/min).
   * 60 min ritual
   * 5 cm mesh around the altars, 10 cm cella + area in front of the altars,
     20 cm far hall and court (court cut at x = 13 m, open there)
   * new receptors: priest leaning over each altar, kneeling, standing on stair 2
 LOW variant: hall ceiling 2.4 m, cella = niche 1.8 m above hall floor, door 2.2 m (cf. arad_low.fds).
 Mesh interfaces are kept off wall faces that carry a HOLE (blocked species transport).
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

 5 cm: altars, stairs and cella opening (split in two along y)
&MESH ID='A5_S', IJK=28,18,32, XB=3.4,4.8, 5.2,6.1, 0.0,1.6, MPI_PROCESS=0 /
&MESH ID='A5_N', IJK=28,18,32, XB=3.4,4.8, 6.1,7.0, 0.0,1.6, MPI_PROCESS=1 /
 10 cm: cella, column above the altars, area in front of the altars
&MESH ID='Cella', IJK=16,24,24, XB=1.8,3.4, 4.8,7.2, 0.0,2.4, MPI_PROCESS=2 /
&MESH ID='N_d',   IJK=14,18,8,  XB=3.4,4.8, 5.2,7.0, 1.6,2.4, MPI_PROCESS=2 /
&MESH ID='N_a',   IJK=28,16,24, XB=3.4,6.2, 3.6,5.2, 0.0,2.4, MPI_PROCESS=3 /
&MESH ID='H_S',   IJK=26,17,12, XB=3.4,8.6, 0.2,3.6, 0.0,2.4, MPI_PROCESS=3 /
&MESH ID='N_b',   IJK=28,14,24, XB=3.4,6.2, 7.0,8.4, 0.0,2.4, MPI_PROCESS=4 /
&MESH ID='N_c',   IJK=14,18,24, XB=4.8,6.2, 5.2,7.0, 0.0,2.4, MPI_PROCESS=4 /
 20 cm: rest of the hall, court
&MESH ID='H_N',   IJK=26,21,12, XB=3.4,8.6, 8.4,12.6, 0.0,2.4, MPI_PROCESS=5 /
&MESH ID='H_E',   IJK=12,24,12, XB=6.2,8.6, 3.6,8.4, 0.0,2.4, MPI_PROCESS=5 /
&MESH ID='Court1', IJK=11,62,20, XB=8.6,10.8, 0.2,12.6, 0.0,4.0, MPI_PROCESS=5 /
&MESH ID='Court2', IJK=11,62,20, XB=10.8,13.0, 0.2,12.6, 0.0,4.0, MPI_PROCESS=6 /

&TIME T_END=3600.0 /
&MISC TMPA=25.0 /
&DUMP DT_DEVC=2.0, NFRAMES=720 /

&REAC FUEL='WOOD', C=1.0, H=1.7, O=0.74, SOOT_YIELD=0.0, HEAT_OF_COMBUSTION=15000.0 /

&SPEC ID='THC',          FORMULA='C21H30O2' /
&SPEC ID='PINENE',       FORMULA='C10H16' /
&SPEC ID='INCENSOLE_AC', FORMULA='C22H38O4' /
&SPEC ID='SMOKE_PM',     FORMULA='C20H40', MASS_EXTINCTION_COEFFICIENT=4400.0 /

 Source terms on 0.1 x 0.1 m heaps (0.01 m2), kg/m2/s
   S altar: dung 1 g/min + cannabis 2 g/min (partly burning) -> ~0.5 kW
            THC 2 g/min x 5% x 50% = 50 mg/min = 8.33e-7 kg/s
            PM: dung 20 mg/min + cannabis 40 g/kg x 2 g/min = 80 -> 100 mg/min
   N altar: unchanged (frankincense 0.5 g/min on animal fat, 0.33 kW)
&SURF ID='CANNABIS_DUNG', HRRPUA=50.0, TAU_Q=-30.0, RGB=200,120,40,
      SPEC_ID='THC','SMOKE_PM', MASS_FLUX=8.33E-5,1.667E-4, TAU_MF=-30.0,-30.0 /
&SURF ID='FRANK_FAT', HRRPUA=33.0, TAU_Q=-30.0, RGB=255,200,60,
      SPEC_ID='PINENE','INCENSOLE_AC','SMOKE_PM', MASS_FLUX=5.8E-5,4.2E-6,3.75E-5, TAU_MF=-30.0,-30.0,-30.0 /

&SURF ID='FIELDSTONE', RGB=176,156,120 /
&SURF ID='MUDBRICK',   RGB=196,160,112 /
&SURF ID='PLASTER',    RGB=232,224,204 /
&SURF ID='LIMESTONE',  RGB=226,216,188 /
&SURF ID='RED_STONE',  RGB=168,52,40 /
&SURF ID='EARTH',      RGB=210,190,150 /

&VENT MB='ZMIN', SURF_ID='EARTH' /
 open boundaries on the court meshes only (MB='ZMAX' would open every mesh top)
&VENT ID='Court_sky',  XB=8.6,13.0, 0.2,12.6, 4.0,4.0, SURF_ID='OPEN' /
&VENT ID='Court_east', XB=13.0,13.0, 0.2,12.6, 0.0,4.0, SURF_ID='OPEN' /

 ---------------- hall ----------------
