&HOLE XB=7.2,8.2, 5.2,6.5, 0.0,2.2 /    hall door 1.3 x 2.2 m
&HOLE XB=3.6,4.2, 5.5,6.6, 0.0,1.8 /    cella opening = full niche height

 ---------------- cella ----------------
&OBST ID='Cella_W', XB=1.8,2.4, 4.8,7.2, 0.0,2.4, SURF_ID='FIELDSTONE' /
&OBST ID='Cella_S', XB=2.4,3.6, 4.8,5.5, 0.0,2.4, SURF_ID='FIELDSTONE' /
