 altars at true size on the 5 cm grid (N 29.7 cm sq x 52 cm; S 20x21 cm x 40 cm)
&OBST ID='Altar_N_frankincense', XB=3.90,4.20, 6.30,6.60, 0.2,0.70, SURF_ID='LIMESTONE', PERMIT_HOLE=.FALSE. /
&OBST ID='Altar_S_cannabis',     XB=4.00,4.20, 5.50,5.70, 0.2,0.60, SURF_ID='LIMESTONE', PERMIT_HOLE=.FALSE. /
&VENT XB=4.00,4.10, 6.40,6.50, 0.70,0.70, SURF_ID='FRANK_FAT' /
&VENT XB=4.05,4.15, 5.55,5.65, 0.60,0.60, SURF_ID='CANNABIS_DUNG' /

 ---------------- court ----------------
