 ---------------- receptors (breathing zone) ----------------
 P1 priest standing in front of the altars   P2 inside the cella (standing on cella floor)
 P3 hall centre   P4 S bench seated   P5 W bench seated   P6 N end   P7 doorway   P8 court
 P9  priest leaning over the cannabis altar (face 0.4 m above the heap, 0.3 m east)
 P10 priest leaning over the frankincense altar
 P11 priest kneeling in front of the altars
 P12 priest standing on stair 2 between the altars (in the cella opening)
